[1753.5486924648285,"o","\nGame: Standard Reversi\r"]
[1753.5487446784973,"o","\nBoard: 8 x 8\r"]
[1753.5488226413727,"o","\n"]
[1753.5491466522217,"o","\nPlayers: X (Player 1, moves first) and O (Player 2 or Computer). \u001b[40;65H\r\nStart: (4,4)=O, (4,5)=X, (5,4)=X, (5,5)=O.\r\nRules: Place a disk so it traps opponent disks in a straight line\u001b[40;65H\r\n       (horizontal, vertical or diagonal) with one of your disks "]
[1753.549206495285,"o","\r\n\u001b[39;65H at the other end.\r\n       All trapped disks flip to your colour.\r\n       Every move must flip at least one disk.\r\n       If you have no legal move, your turn is skipped automatica\r\n\u001b[39;65Hally.\r\n       The game ends when neither player can move."]
[1753.5492858886719,"o","\u001b[?25l\r\nMove: P3:4 (place a disk at row 3, column 4)\r\nWin: The player with MORE disks wins. Equal counts = draw.       \u001b[40;59H\u001b[?25h\r\n"]
[1753.5495190620422,"o","\n\nCommands(Type one command on your turn):\r"]
[1753.5496203899384,"o","\nHow to make a move: Gomoku O3:4 (H3:4 / E3:4 in Plus), Reversi P3\r\n\u001b[39;65H3:4\r"]
[1753.549705028534,"o","\nundo: Revert the previous full turn (both players' moves)        \r"]
[1753.5497891902924,"o","\nredo: Replay the turn you just undid\r"]
[1753.5499453544617,"o","\nsave: Enter save to save game\r"]
[1753.5500059127808,"o","\nload: Enter load to load game\r"]
[1753.550053358078,"o","\nhelp: Show this screen\r"]
[1753.5500929355621,"o","\nquit: Leave the game\r"]
